Hi Jacqueline,

as far as I understand the situation there are 2 alternatives to a negative binomial distribution (e.g. Implementing a Poisson-lognormal, which is really straightforward).
Solomon Kurz wrote a blog post about this, which might be helpful: https://solomonkurz.netlify.app/post/2021-07-12-got-overdispersion-try-observation-level-random-effects-with-the-poisson-lognormal-mixture/

Best regards,
Frederik

